# presentation/ — gitignored per user decision 2026-09-19. 32 tracked files,
# 14 MB, including an 8.3 MB third-party _template_slidesgo.pptx. Untracked
# from the index (git rm --cached -r) but left on disk. The per-file entries
# that used to carve out presentation/handoff_deck_build/* individually are
# now redundant and have been removed (see git history at commit predating
# this change for the old list) — this line covers the whole directory.
presentation/

# Canonical tracked documentation stays in the repo. docs/ is a source-of-truth
# project asset, not private scratch, and must NOT be added to this file
# (a prior claim that docs/ was gitignored was wrong and has been corrected:
# `git ls-files docs/` returns tracked files and `git check-ignore` matches
# none of them). presentation/ (above) is the opposite:
# gitignored working material, not a canonical tracked asset.

